<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Bundesliga matches</p>
<p>played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Bochum 3 (Baluszynski 17th minute, Mamic 67th, Michalke 90th)</p>
<p>Hamburg 1 (Breitenreiter 75th). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 24,135.</p>
<p>St Pauli 0 Cologne 0. 19,572.</p>
<p>Borussia Moenchengladbach 5 (Neun 14th, Heinrich own goal 22nd,</p>
<p>Pettersson 32nd, Effenberg 49th, Juskowiak 63rd) Borussia</p>
<p>Dortmund 1 (Zorc 41st). 3-1. 34,500.</p>
<p>VfB Stuttgart 0 Fortuna Duesseldorf 2 (Juran 83rd and 86th).</p>
<p>0-0. 40,000.</p>
<p>Arminia Bielefeld 0 Schalke 1 (Max 16th). 0-1. 22,212.</p>
<p>Bayern Munich 1 (Zickler 19th) Karlsruhe 0. 1-0. 63,000.</p>
